[00:00.00]ambition 例 With all their passion and ambition, they should have an intuitive understanding of cycles and markets. 尽管拥有激情和雄心，但他 们也应该对经济周期和市场有直觉的理解。
[00:13.87]board 例 As the chairman of the board, he has supreme power. 作为董事会主席，他拥有至高无 上的权力。
[00:20.73]astute 例 Astute businesses keep pace with changes by paying attention to such factors as personnel changes, new product lines, etc. 精 明的企业通过关注一些因素，如人事变动、新的 生产线等，来与变化保持同步。
