[01:26.66]showcase 例 The project can fully showcase your leadership skills. 这个项目能充分展现你的领导 才能。
[01:34.67]accordance 例 In accordance with the law, women enjoy equal rights with men in their political and economic life. 根据法律，女性在政治和经济生 活中享有与男性同等的权利。
[01:48.12]exterior 例 Our offlce building has an exterior stairway. 我们的办公大楼有个室外楼梯。
