[02:04.42]drawback 例 Slow speed is the chief drawback of sea shipment. 海运最大的缺点是速度慢。
[02:11.57]arrears 例 Due to the immature development of construction market and imperfect credit system, the arrears of wages is a very big problem. 由于建筑市场的发展尚不成熟以及信用 机制不够健全，拖欠工程款的问题十分严重。
